### Curl HTTP requests for ReactApp2.Server
### - currently includes requests for GET Checklist and WorkItem
### - can be later expanded to include other requests within the API

@ReactApp2.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5093

###
GET {{ReactApp2.Server_HostAddress}}/api/checklist/
Accept: application/json
###
GET {{ReactApp2.Server_HostAddress}}/api/workitem/
Accept: application/json
